# OK-211 — every version pin, digest and checksum of this spike (BRIEF B6).
#
# Sourced by the scripts (bash) and included by the Makefile (`include` +
# `export`). Plain KEY=value only: no quotes, no spaces, no `#` inside values,
# so both parsers read the same thing. Researched and verified 2026-10-30, see
# evidence/00-preflight.md.

