# --- Kourier gateway (Envoy) ---------------------------------------------------
# kourier.yaml references a floating tag, not a digest (00-preflight.md, STOP-4).
# CP1 decision (a): the manifest stays unchanged; knative-verify compares the
# imageID the gateway pod actually runs with this digest (= v1.37.11 on
# 2026-10-30) and fails on any difference.
